      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOMETHING ROYAL (4) got back to winning ways last time after knocking on the door for a while, winning by 0.6L. Pike now hops on board and he remains in the same grade. Only rises 1.5kg and with his early speed, he can make every post a winner once again. WHO'S BENT (1) dipped at the end of last campaign but has trialled sweetly in readiness for this. O'Donnell's claim comes in handy with his racing pattern and he looks set to fire on resumption. BOSISTO (3) won a trial in readiness for his return. He's a fresh winner in the past and while he returns in stronger company, his best form stacks up. Can return on a good note in a suitable race. PAINT IT RED (2) finished behind SOMETHING ROYAL last start and should be up front from the outset once again. Won't be far away. LIEUTENANT DUNBAR (5) can feature with CJP taking the ride.",
